  "text": "The CPP Modernization features a community-led volunteer model with gender parity, inclusive coverage of displaced populations, and joint governance by national and Red Crescent entities. It employs multi-channel warning systems and has a recognized life-saving record, having received the Smith Tumsaroch Fund Award for its effectiveness. The program aligns with national disaster policies and emphasizes training residents in risk communication.",
